INT. MERIDIAN SYNERGY CORP. - BREAK ROOM - DAY

A fluorescent box with a mini-trampoline in the center, installed under a banner: "WELLNESS IS A JOURNEY."

PHILLIPA, 40s, regional VP, stands on the trampoline in a blazer, bouncing in small, tight, politically correct hops. OGDEN, 30s, analyst, and TANVI, 20s, intern, watch from either side of the microwave.

PHILLIPA
Team, this is about psychological safety.

OGDEN
Totally.

TANVI
Totally.

Phillipa bounces. A button on her blazer pops off and ricochets across the room. All three track it. It lands in the coffee. Nobody breathes.

PHILLIPA
I'd like to hear thoughts.

OGDEN and Tanvi both open their mouths. Both close them. Both look at the coffee.

OGDEN
It's... buoyant.

TANVI
It's very buoyant.

Phillipa steps off the trampoline. The three of them scatter in different directions. The trampoline keeps bouncing slightly, alone.
